cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Cèrcol
message: If you use this software or its dataset, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Matoses
    given-names: Miquel
repository-code: "https://github.com/cercol/cercol"
url: "https://cercol.team"
abstract: >-
  An open-source personality assessment platform built on the public-domain
  IPIP item pool, implementing the IPIP-NEO in six languages with client-side
  scoring, a peer-rating instrument, and a documented, citable scoring
  pipeline.
keywords:
  - personality assessment
  - Big Five
  - IPIP
  - IPIP-NEO
  - psychometrics
  - open science
  - peer report
license: MIT
